Link with the version script unconditionally. get_supported_link_arguments()
probes it by linking an executable, which fails on MidnightBSD because the
map's "local: *;" hides environ/__progname from crt1.o, so the version
nodes were silently dropped.

--- src/meson.build.orig
+++ src/meson.build
@@ -87,7 +87,7 @@
   ],
   dependencies : libxmlb_deps,
   c_args : release_args,
-  link_args : cc.get_supported_link_arguments([vflag]),
+  link_args : [vflag],
   vs_module_defs: def_file_target,
   link_depends : mapfile,
   install : true
